{c: Verse 1}
[C#] [C#],        Onkar Swarupa.... Omkar Swarupa
[C#] [D],        Onkaaaaar Swarupaaaa....
[C#] [C#] [C#],        Tuza Namo..Tuza Namo..Tuza Namo..
[C#] [Bm] [D],        Onkaar swarupa, sad&#8205;aguru samartha
[Bm] [C#],        Anaathaachya naatha, tuj namo
[C#] [C#] [C#],        Tuj namo, tuj namo, tuj namo
[C#],        Namo maayabaapa, gurukripaaghana
[C#],        Todi ya bndhana maayaamoha
[C#] [Bm],        Mohojaal maajhe kon nirashil
[C#] [Bm] [D],        Tujawin dayaala sad&#8205;agururaaya
[C#] [C#] [C#],        Tuj namo, tuj namo, tuj namo
[C#],        Sad&#8205;agururaaya maajha anndasaagar
[C#],        Trailokya adhaar gururaaw
[C#] [B] [D],        Gururaaw swaami ase swaynprakaash
[C#] [D],        Jya pudhe udaas chndr rawi
[Bm] [C#],        Jya pudhe udaas chndr rawi
[C#],        Rawi, shashi, agni, nenati jya rupa
[C#],        Swaprakaasharupa nene wed
[C#] [Bm],        Eka janaardani, guruparabramh
[Bm] [C#],        Tayaache pai naam sada mukhi
[C#],        Onkar Swarupa....
